                                    <p>Small round cippus found in the shrine of Men Askaenos east of Antioch. LVS interpreted as Luna(e) votum solvit, connecting this to Men. Set up by decree of the decuriones at the command of the Caristiani, for Drosera and Miletos, parents of Tiberius Claudius Epinicus.</p>
